#. y1:english="Huh? You want something from me, mister?\nOh, you understand my singing?\nYou have good taste in music.||So are you flirting with me?\nYou know, you're my type.||But, unfortunately, I have to go to the bar.\nBar?\nI work at a hostess bar called||\"Shine\" on Pink St.\nI have such a bad hangover.||I really wanted to call in sick.\nI'm sorry. I hope you can understand.❤\nHuh? Shut up!||You're so mean!"
#: MEDIA/STGTALK/SPA/DAY_KAB0017.BIN:78_0_8
msgctxt "MEDIA/STGTALK/SPA/DAY_KAB0017.BIN::line:78_0_8"
msgid "¿Eh? iCállate!||iQué desagradable!"
msgstr ""

#. y1:source=MEDIA/STGTALK/SPA/DAY_KAB0017.BIN
